posts.text:
Alternative and deleted scenes from the Marvel films in the "Infinity Saga" box set:

- Thor attempting to kiss Valkyrie;  
- The Supreme Intelligence appearing in its true form against Captain Marvel;  
- Jane and Thor's farewell;  
- Test reel featuring Proxima Midnight with Captain America’s shield;  
- Test reel with Ebony Maw;  
- Alternate scene from Age of Ultron introducing the first version of Captain Marvel;  
- Hulk destroying the Hulkbuster.

